---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import { SITE } from '../lib/site.js'

const updated = 'October 7, 2026'
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${SITE.agentName} collects, uses, and protects your information, including website analytics and what happens when you share your email on this site.`}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl text-brand">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-500">Last updated {updated}</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-stone-600">
      This site is operated by {SITE.agentName}, a licensed Idaho real estate agent with {SITE.brokerage}.
      This page explains what information we collect, why, and what we do with it.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 rounded-lg bg-gold/10 p-6">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-xl text-brand">Email &amp; contact sign-up: the deal, plainly</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-stone-700">
        <li>
          <strong>What you're signing up for:</strong> when you submit the Get Started form or email us, you're
          asking {SITE.agentName} to contact you about your request: flat-fee services, a free For Sale By Owner
          consultation, or your question.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>How we'll contact you:</strong> you choose. The forms let you pick phone call, text, email, or any
          combination, and we'll use the ways you selected. Follow-up is about your request and is not a mass
          mailing list.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>We don't sell your information.</strong> Not your email, not your phone number, not your address.
          We don't rent it or trade it either.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>No obligation:</strong> sharing your info doesn't commit you to hiring anyone or paying anything.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Opt out anytime:</strong> reply "stop" or email
          <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-medium text-gold-dark">{SITE.email}</a>
          and we'll stop contacting you and delete your information on request.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-stone-600">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Information you give us</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Only what you choose to share through the Get Started form: your name, email address, phone number
          (optional), the city or area of the property, whether you're buying or selling, the services you're
          interested in, and your timeline. If you email or call us directly, we also keep that correspondence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">How we use it</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          To respond to your request, schedule a consultation, provide quotes and the services you select, and
          follow up about them. We don't use it for anything unrelated.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Website analytics (Google Analytics)</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We use Google Analytics, a service of Google LLC, to understand how visitors use this site. When you visit,
          Google Analytics sets cookies in your browser and collects information such as the pages you view, how long
          you stay, how you arrived (for example from a search or another site), your approximate location (city
          level), and your device, browser, and IP address.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We use this only to see which pages are useful and to improve the site. It is not used to identify you
          personally, and we do not combine it with the information you submit in forms. Google may process this data
          under its own privacy policy, available at
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="font-medium text-gold-dark" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          <strong>Opting out:</strong> you can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, turn on your
          browser's "Do Not Track" or privacy features, or install Google's
          <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="font-medium text-gold-dark" rel="noopener">browser add-on to opt out of Google Analytics</a>.
          The site works normally either way.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Apart from analytics, this site does not use advertising cookies and does not sell data to advertisers. Our
          hosting provider may also log basic technical information, such as IP address and browser type, to keep the
          site secure and working.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Who sees your information</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          {SITE.agentName} and, where needed to provide a service you request, {SITE.brokerage}. Form submissions
          are stored with our database provider (Supabase) and the site is hosted on Vercel; these providers process
          data only to run the site for us. Analytics data is processed by Google as described above. We may disclose
          information if required by law.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Form and contact information is kept as long as needed to handle your request and any resulting
          transaction, and for record-keeping required of real estate licensees. You can ask us to delete it sooner
          at any time. Analytics data is retained according to our Google Analytics settings.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Your choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          You can ask to see, correct, or delete the information we hold about you, or opt out of contact, by emailing
          <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-medium text-gold-dark">{SITE.email}</a> or calling
          <a href={`tel:${SITE.phoneRaw}`} class="font-medium text-gold-dark">{SITE.phone}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Children</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">This site is not intended for anyone under 18, and we don't knowingly collect their information.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Changes</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">If this policy changes, we'll update the date at the top of this page.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-stone-900">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          {SITE.agentName}, {SITE.brokerage}, {SITE.addressLocality}, {SITE.addressRegion} &middot;
          <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-medium text-gold-dark">{SITE.email}</a> &middot; {SITE.phone}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
